---
// Icons are inline so the page makes zero external requests.
const icon = "size-6 text-primary";
---

<section id="features" class="scroll-mt-16 px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <h2
      class="max-w-2xl text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance text-neutral-950 sm:text-5xl"
    >
      Built different
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8">
        <svg
          class={icon}
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.75"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"></rect>
          <path d="M3 15h9V3"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-950">
          Plans that fit your constraints
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600">
          Budget and hours are hard inputs. €400 a month and 4 hours a week gets
          a plan you can actually execute, not an agency fantasy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8">
        <svg
          class={icon}
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.75"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M12 21V10"></path>
          <path d="M12 10 4 3"></path>
          <path d="m12 10 8-7"></path>
          <circle cx="12" cy="21" r="1.5"></circle>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-950">
          Decisions, not just content
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600">
          Kampa picks 2-3 channels and tells you why it rejected the others. No
          more guessing where to post.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8">
        <svg
          class={icon}
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.75"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M4 6h16"></path>
          <path d="M4 12h10"></path>
          <path d="M4 18h13"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-950">
          Copy in your voice
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600">
          Paste a few of your real posts; every asset is written to sound like
          you, not like AI slop.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8">
        <svg
          class={icon}
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.75"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
          <path d="M12 12 16 8"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-950">
          Live cost meter
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600">
          See tokens and euros as you go. A full campaign costs about €1. Jasper
          charges €69 a month for less.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8">
        <svg
          class={icon}
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.75"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2.5"></rect>
          <path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-950">
          Nothing leaves your browser
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600">
          No account, no server, no database. Your business data and API key
          stay on your machine; the only network call is to Anthropic. The code
          is open source — check it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8">
        <svg
          class={icon}
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.75"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M4 15v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-4"></path>
          <path d="M12 3v12"></path>
          <path d="m8 11 4 4 4-4"></path>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-950">
          Own your plan
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600">
          Export Markdown, PDF, calendar file. No lock-in, no seat license, no
          vendor.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
